  <main class="legal shell"><span class="eyebrow">Working together</span><h1 class="section-title">Terms of Service</h1><p class="updated">Last updated: 24 September 2026</p><p>This website describes full-stack web development services offered by JoyLabs Software Studio. Sending an inquiry does not create a project agreement or payment obligation.</p><h2>Service packages</h2><p>The listed starting packages are: Landing Page Website at Rp3.500.000; Admin Dashboard Starter at Rp5.000.000; Business Web Application Starter at Rp7.500.000; E-commerce Web Application starting at Rp10.000.000; UX Research &amp; Product Planning at Rp250.000 per hour; and Cloud Hosting Setup &amp; Deployment at Rp1.000.000. Custom Full-Stack Development is Rp250.000 per hour.</p><p>Package prices cover only the scope listed on the service catalog. Additional requirements, features, integrations, user roles, revisions, or infrastructure needs may affect the final price. JoyLabs confirms the final quotation before development begins. Custom project pricing is calculated from estimated development hours at Rp250.000 per hour.</p><h2>UX research and planning</h2><p>UX Research &amp; Product Planning covers requirements, user and business workflows, journeys, flows, information architecture, feature priorities, usability reviews, and functional requirements. It does not include Figma UI design, high-fidelity visual mockups, branding, or graphic design.</p><h2>Payment</h2><p>After project scope and price are agreed, JoyLabs sends a Midtrans Payment Link. Payment is completed through the Midtrans-hosted payment page. This website does not provide checkout or accept payment directly.</p><h2>Project delivery</h2><p>Work begins after the proposal is approved and the agreed payment step is completed. Delivery, review, and any ongoing maintenance are handled as described in the project proposal.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For questions about these terms, use the contact details shown in the contact section of this website.</p><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/#contact">Back to contact</a></main>
